      373.69,
      539.93,
      420.76
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of the powers vested in me under Sections 32, 33 and 34 of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973, I, Navin EranjanDissanayake, Minister of Tourism and Sports, do hereby inform that the appointments of the office bearers of the Sri LankaCricket are cancelled from 01st of April 2015 and the names of persons given below are appointed from 01st April 2015 to carryout the functions of Sri Lanka Cricket until an election is held or until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
